To M.HAWLEY To write pixels in Forth, you have to access the DOS video driver
or use the ANSI system. The exact call depends on your system. In MS/DOS you
would use a call to interrupt 10H. There is a file 660 VIDEO.ARC that is
described as "Video words for IBM F83". Look into it. It would be appreciated
if you would let us know whether it does what you want.   Leonard.
